{"id": "auo-2026-07-02-007", "date": "2026-07-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["auo"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["[否定]growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "AUO pushes AI-era transformation with executive reshuffle, launch of innovation institute", "content": "Taiwanese optoelectronics specialist AUO announced organizational adjustments and senior executive appointments on July 1 as it continues to advance its business transformation. The company is aiming for balanced development across its businesses and accelerating its transition into a key solutions provider centered on display technologies for its long-term growth momentum. The company also unveiled its new Institute of Innovation and New Venture.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260701PD238/auo-optoelectronics-business-development-display.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-07-02-008", "date": "2026-07-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Analysis: How long can memory's AI-driven boom last?", "content": "The global memory market is enjoying one of its most profitable cycles in years. AI data center demand has driven DRAM and NAND prices sharply higher, and the three companies that dominate global supply &mdash; Micron, Samsung, and SK Hynix &mdash; are posting results that would have seemed unlikely two years ago.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260701VL221/memory-chips-dram-demand-micron-sk-hynix-samsung.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-02-009", "date": "2026-07-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.25, "keywords": ["outperform", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "DDI makers look to smaller displays as NB and TV demand loses momentum in 2H26", "content": "<p class=\"P1\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:416;183-598\">Large-size display driver ICs (DDIs) were a key revenue driver for many DDI suppliers during the first half of 2026. Taiwanese manufacturers said early notebook inventory build-up beginning in the first quarter of 2026, together with television restocking ahead of the 2026 FIFA World Cup in the United States, Canada, and Mexico, allowed large-size DDI shipments to outperform the traditional seasonal slowdown.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260702PD216/demand-display-ddi-2026-market.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-02-010", "date": "2026-07-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.25, "keywords": ["[否定]record", "growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Taiwan's Eurocharm eyes peak 2026 on North American powersports cycle, Vietnam EV shift, and server rack entry", "content": "Taiwan's major precision parts maker Eurocharm Holdings is forecasting a record-breaking 2026, driven by robust North American SUV-related demand, a structural shift toward electric scooters in Vietnam, and early traction in a new server rack business expected to become a key growth driver from 2027. The company expects full-year revenue to approach NT$9 billion (approx. US$281.9 million) as its diversified order base strengthens across automotive, powersports, and electronics segments.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260702PD221/electric-scooter-server-rack-revenue-taiwan-2026.html", "type": "rss"}]}
